{"diagnosis": "Fetch progress max_addr is stuck at 0x00000000 vs expected advance, with `TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000` and tohost `FAIL 0xdead`. Trace window has no per-cycle data and CONE_SLICE is empty, so exact linkage to excerpt is unclear. Within excerpt lines 401-427 the `case (mem_wordsize)` has no default/pre-assign, so X/3 poisons mem_rdata_word and stalls first fetch.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -401,7 +401,10 @@
 	always @* begin
+		mem_la_wdata = reg_op2;
+		mem_la_wstrb = 4'b1111;
+		mem_rdata_word = mem_rdata;
 		(* full_case *)
 		case (mem_wordsize)
 			0: begin
", "expected": "tohost 0x1 PASS with no `TRAP: no progress` and max_addr advancing beyond 0x00000000"}

